<title>USA: Bear Stearns sets 5 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Bear Stearns sets 5 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns Cos Inc said Wednesday it had set a five percent stock dividend, payable February 28, record February 14.</p>
<p>The company also declared a regular quarterly dividend of $0.15 a share, payable February 28, record February 14.</p>
<p>It said the quarterly dividend will be paid on shares outstanding on February 14 and will not be paid on shares issued as a result of the stock dividend.</p>
